          "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thanks for making time for this pre-launch review. As you all know, we're looking at an $18 million senior unsecured bond issuance to refinance existing debt and fund our approved environmental projects. The preliminary term sheet has a 3-year tenor, 5.50% fixed coupon, settlement on September 15, 2026, and currently no sustainability label or redemption protections specified. Before I sign off on the final terms, I want to walk through this with all of you \u2014 sustainability, investor coverage, treasury, and legal \u2014 to make sure we're comfortable with the structure and haven't missed anything. Let's start with the sustainability angle \u2014 given that a portion of the proceeds is earmarked for environmental projects, has anyone given thought to whether we should be exploring a sustainability-linked or green label on this bond?",
          "speaker": "A1",
